{"overview":"داستان واقعی پرهیجانی دربارهٔ یک بازیگر ناشناخته که باور ریشه‌دار داشت نه تنها باید «راکِی» را بنویسد، بلکه باید خود را «راکِی بالبوآ» بازی کند؛ با رد «نه» در هر قدم، سیلوستر استالونه همه چیز را روی خودش می‌گذارد و در برابر شانس‌های به‌نظر غیرممکن، برای نقش اصلی می‌ایستد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The electrifying true story about an unknown actor with an unshakable belief that he wasn't just meant to write Rocky—he was meant to be Rocky Balboa. Told \"no\" at every turn, Sylvester Stallone bets everything on himself, holding the line on playing the lead against seemingly impossible odds.","tagline_en":"The true underdog story.","runtime":128,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["Peter Farrelly"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US","AU"],"cast":[{"name":"Anthony Ippolito","role":"Sylvester Stallone","photo":"/a5wHhLA0HwOHnoajmFGpMRtY6OT.jpg"},{"name":"آناسوفیا راب","role":"Sasha Czack","photo":"/mJawWikGXsSLA79mZ9xqhn0B9gI.jpg","en":"AnnaSophia Robb"},{"name":"استفان جیمز","role":"Carl Weathers","photo":"/itWiVFI7uE8s4QQjcQBbVO0hY7K.jpg","en":"Stephan James"},{"name":"مت دیلون","role":"Frank Stallone Sr.","photo":"/wVoSUexYH79igPgxIXKWRlV2uBk.jpg","en":"Matt Dillon"},{"name":"پی. جی. برن","role":"Irwin Winkler","photo":"/1JVBaxRy3OxkHymD3nwBd5kVWWL.jpg","en":"P.J. Byrne"},{"name":"جی دپلاس","role":"John Avildsen","photo":"/eUY0JDlqzf5pE9pmdvv4IPU3NYn.jpg","en":"Jay Duplass"},{"name":"Kiki Seto","role":"Talia Shire","photo":"/wqxzo5bQWbgRmldWhJu4abmepbV.jpg"},{"name":"Toby Kebbell","role":"Robert Chartoff","photo":"/mlYytYJvoEHmhDH2enLtES1098Q.jpg"},{"name":"تریسی لتس","role":"Sandy Maddox","photo":"/x318yEddF10ASORC5U958C2kowf.jpg","en":"Tracy Letts"},{"name":"Robert Morgan","role":"Burgess Meredith","photo":"/dZhqn7yOmgetvM2mAWU7sEMmzu7.jpg"},{"name":"Saul Stein","role":"Sal","photo":"/bDRdpx2tzNfDrYpgbJzmjKz7kCF.jpg"},{"name":"Trevor St. John","role":"Grant Bader","photo":"/hrBoF5u263objhRDuV7YCCLl7eH.jpg"}],"trailer":"Kpc4o2J28QE","